    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25103" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλᾰλ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>talk with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.85.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1417.24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἑαυτοῖς ὑπέρ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					9.32.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ συμμορίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					6.57
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἀλλήλους τί ἂν ποιήσειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					6.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτὴν ἐν αὑτῇ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.141d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινί τι</span>
			<i>talk over</i> a thing <i>with</i> another, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				175
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be much talked of,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Luc.
				1.65
			</span></i>.</div>
